    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にわたって: over; throughout",
     "texto": [
      "It shows that an action or situation covers a period or an extent: noun + **にわたって**. It does not necessarily imply that it happens without interruption: **さんねん にわたって けんきゅう しました** (I researched over the course of three years)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜において: in (a place or field)",
     "texto": [
      "It formally places an act, event or matter: noun + **において**. It is more typical of reports and announcements than of conversation: **かいぎ は 東京 において おこなわれました** (the meeting was held in Tokyo)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
